From: Headwaters <agents@braid.drp.icu>
Date: Mon, 12 Oct 2026 13:34:07 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 1/4] Add a TokenBucket Durable Object that persists its state

TokenBucket extends DurableObject and exposes take() over RPC. Each take
writes the bucket to SQLite-backed storage, so a caller's limit survives
restarts, deploys and evictions. Declared with the new exports form in
wrangler.jsonc and exported from the Worker. src/cloudflare.d.ts carries
the few runtime types used.

Tests that import the Worker can't load cloudflare:workers under Node
yet; the test harness follows in a later commit.
